{"fact_id": "A001", "original_fact_id": "F01", "text": "A于2006年5月24日星期三出狱假释，乘火车返回马德拉，在朋友家过第一夜；因朋友要搬家，只能住一夜。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0014"], "epistemic_status": "reported_event", "roles": ["R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": []}
{"fact_id": "A002", "original_fact_id": "F02", "text": "A在5月25日接受初次假释访谈。B在接收表上标记“Yes”并圈出“PC 290”，注记“To register, 290 PC by 5-31-06”；B作证说这表示她亲自告知A须在五日内登记，并让他5月26日见指定假释官C。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0015", "CL-O2256789-P0017"], "epistemic_status": "attributed_testimony", "roles": ["R_INTAKE_AGENT", "R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D02"]}
{"fact_id": "A003", "original_fact_id": "F03", "text": "A于5月25日星期四夜间住在马德拉救助站。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0018"], "epistemic_status": "reported_event", "roles": ["R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": []}
{"fact_id": "A004", "original_fact_id": "F04", "text": "5月26日，A告诉C自己住在救助站。C要求其登记，并在假释档案中记载须在5月31日前登记；C说救助站离学校太近，A不能继续住在那里。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0019"], "epistemic_status": "reported_interaction", "roles": ["R_ASSIGNED_AGENT", "R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D03"]}
{"fact_id": "A005", "original_fact_id": "F05", "text": "C安排A住在马德拉县境内一间汽车旅馆，把A及另一名假释人员送去，并要求两人向县警长部门登记。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0020"], "epistemic_status": "reported_interaction", "roles": ["R_ASSIGNED_AGENT", "R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D03"]}
