{"fact_id": "A007", "original_fact_id": "F07", "text": "C在安置A后的五日内进行强制家访，发现A不在指定房间，个人物品也已带走；C另一天再去，A仍不在。两个家访的具体日期未记载。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0021"], "epistemic_status": "reported_observation", "roles": ["R_ASSIGNED_AGENT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D11"]}
{"fact_id": "A008", "original_fact_id": "F08", "text": "A于5月27日星期六搬到马德拉市内一名堂表亲家中，并在那里待到6月3日星期六被捕。原文未给出亲属姓名和地址。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0022"], "epistemic_status": "reported_event", "roles": ["R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": []}
{"fact_id": "A009", "original_fact_id": "F09", "text": "A作证解释搬走是因为有人到旅馆房间绑架、威胁他；他逃脱后仍害怕。这是A的说法，来源没有独立确认绑架、威胁的真实性或详情。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0022"], "epistemic_status": "contested_defendant_account", "roles": ["R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": []}
{"fact_id": "A010", "original_fact_id": "F10", "text": "原文记载A未尝试联系C，也未登记；此前5月26日见C时尚未向警察或县警长登记。登记机关的原始查询记录未附。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2256789-P0019", "CL-O2256789-P0022"], "epistemic_status": "reported_nonregistration", "roles": ["R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D05"]}
